    "text_blocks": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Yes, standard homeowners insurance policies in Utah typically cover hail damage to your roof, siding, and other physical structures on your property."
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "What is Covered"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Dwelling Coverage: Pays to repair or replace your home's structure, including the roof, siding, windows, and skylights damaged by hail."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Other Structures: Covers detached buildings like fences, sheds, and detached garages."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Personal Property: Protects outdoor belongings (like patio furniture or a grill) if they are damaged by a hailstorm.\n(Note: Vehicles damaged by hail are covered under auto insurance with comprehensive coverage, not your homeowners policy .)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Important Exceptions in Utah"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Deductibles: Many policies use a separate, higher deductible for wind and hail damage rather than your standard all-peril deductible."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Cosmetic Exclusions: Some insurers in hail-prone regions exclude purely cosmetic dents (such as minor siding discoloration or minor roof denting) if the function of the material is not compromised."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Maintenance Issues: Damage caused by long-term neglect or pre-existing wear-and-tear on an old roof will not be covered."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "You can learn more about managing property claims via the Utah Insurance Department . You can also review regional risk factors through providers like Openly Utah Homeowners Insurance or GEICO Homeowners Insurance in Utah .",
        "snippet_links": [
          {
            "text": "Utah Insurance Department",
            "link": "https://insurance.utah.gov/consumers/home-insurance/home-claims-info/"
          },
          {
